scroll of enchant {armor|weapon} at {+3|+5}, I can often get it up
to {+5|+7} or so.

It seems like the "blessed" status of the scroll doesn't help as much
when the {armor|weapon} is at {+3|+5} though, I feel like I get a +1
enchantment much more often than when the enchantments are lower.

